    "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><img class=\"aligncenter  wp-image-439\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2013/04/bindmans.jpg\" alt=\"bindmans\" width=\"150\" height=\"165\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>According to the CFI.co judging panel, Bindmans are the rising stars of employment law in the United Kingdom and the winners of the award for 2013.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The firm, founded by Sir Geoffrey Bindman QC, is high profile with focused and intelligent employment lawyers who are making a difference and bringing in good settlements. Bindmans recently won a substantial award for an Asperger syndrome sufferer in dispute with his former law firm employer and is acting for a lap dancer who used to work at the London club Stringfellows.</p>",
